  unitName: Fire Dragoon Ulkina
  unitId: 10504
  unitNumber: 682
  description: A religious fanatic witch who was raised in a shrine. After the fall
    of the 12 Guardians of the Gods, she immersed herself in her magical studies
    while yearning to join their ranks. In turn, her heart grew darker. She decided
    to pledge herself to the will of the gods themselves instead of to the Guardians,
    and there are reports left behind which state that she judged blasphemous people
    with her fire. In many of these stories it is written that she claimed "those
    who doubt the gods are not fit to live," and took it upon herself to pass this
    type of judgment from village to village.
  summonDesc: All right.<br>I shall help you build<br>your piety.
  fusionDesc: What do you have to gain<br>by endowing me with power?<br>Is this also
    the will of the gods?
  evoDesc: I know full well that the only true<br>power comes from the gods.
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
